            "review_title": "Review at Cairo Lounge Bar",
            "review_text": "Grantwatson777\nAdelaide, Australia1114 contributions\n0\nWhat a fantastic night of playing pool and meeting new people. My best night in Saigon without a doubt\nMay 2022 • Solo\nI found the bar by accident and now I wish I had found it earlier. Free games of pool all night, super friendly staff who can talk English (some better than others) and great beers and spirits. \nThe music was great plus you could pick what you wanted to hear.\nThe don’t have a kitchen but you can order food in. Definitely will be back. My new home away from home\nRead more\nWritten June 8, 2022",
