            "review_title": "Review at Cairo Lounge Bar",
            "review_text": "Mawebb\nWollongong, Australia50 contributions\n0\nFrustrating\nDec 2019\nSmall bar, that should be better. There were four staff on at the time of my visit.\nOne of the staff, I think her name was Knee, seemed excellent and was serving all the customers on her own. Another was tidying and organising the bar.\nThe other two staff were on their phones the entire time, so it took a lot longer to get served than it should have.\n\nI had two beers and a meal, but it was too frustrating to try and get the attention of the one person looking after customers so I left early.\nRead more\nWritten December 8, 2019",
