            "review_title": "Review at Cairo Lounge Bar",
            "review_text": "Grantwatson777\nAdelaide, Australia1114 contributions\n1\nThe classiest bar in saigon\nJul 2019 • Solo\nWas lucky enough to be in Saigon for the opening of this new bar. The decor is so classy, not the normal cheap attempt. They have a fantastic pool table and soccer table and even dart boards. The atmosphere is fabulous and the girls are very pretty and friendly. They are not pushy asking you to buy them a drink, they are happy to sit with you and talk (and practice their English).\nThe manager My was so welcoming, she made sure we had a good night. The music is a great mix with plenty of 60’s, 70’s and 80’s for us oldies and recent stuff for the younger generations.\nThis is easily the best and most beautiful bar in Saigon. You must go for a brilliant night, I will definitely be going back next time I’m in Saigon.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 23, 2019",
